<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM H1 net profit rises 21 pct.</title>
<headline>KLM H1 net profit rises 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996/97 to Sept 96.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     529   vs  437</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected KLM Royal Dutch Airlines to report a first-half net profit of 457-639 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	    5.74  vs  4.73</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     262   vs  497</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)		 4.62  vs  4.33</p>
<p>    Other revenue				  652   vs  615</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions)    5.28  vs  4.94</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses (billions)    5.01  vs  4.44</p>
<p>    Net financial charges			106   vs   93</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales			  7   vs   35</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	   376   vs   77</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings		  50   vs   51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				 589   vs  567</p>
<p>    Tax						 60   vs  130</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
